{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Jelli Nook</strong> is your premiere Jelli shop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">...but it's not open just yet. You'll need to decide what types of Jellies to offer in your shop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this relaxing crafting game, you\u2019ll mix and match ingredients to discover all kinds of jolly little jellies. Combine up to four ingredients at a time and start cooking. Some recipes are simple. Others are more challenging. Every jelly you uncover brings you one step closer to a fully stocked shop menu featuring a total of 60 adorable Jellies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Jelli Nook</strong> is inspired by games like <strong>Little Alchemy</strong>, <strong>Breath of the Wild's cooking mechanic</strong>, and <strong>Slime Rancher</strong>, this game focuses on <strong>experimentation and discovery</strong>. There\u2019s no pressure or timers \u2014 just you, your ingredients, and a cozy space to create.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3667420?t=1745220497","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3667420?t=1745220497","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667420/8107c60ce923c85640587d85e23f5b1e982090de/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745220497","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667420/8107c60ce923c85640587d85e23f5b1e982090de/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745220497","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Jelli Nook</strong> is your premiere Jelli shop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">...but it's not open just yet. You'll need to decide what types of Jellies to offer in your shop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this relaxing crafting game, you\u2019ll mix and match ingredients to discover all kinds of jolly little jellies. Combine up to four ingredients at a time and start cooking. Some recipes are simple. Others are more challenging. Every jelly you uncover brings you one step closer to a fully stocked shop menu featuring a total of 60 adorable Jellies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Jelli Nook</strong> is inspired by games like <strong>Little Alchemy</strong>, <strong>Breath of the Wild's cooking mechanic</strong>, and <strong>Slime Rancher</strong>, this game focuses on <strong>experimentation and discovery</strong>. There\u2019s no pressure or timers \u2014 just you, your ingredients, and a cozy space to create.</p>","developers":["LLimb Games","Grizzly Moose Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667420/7bfc2265e487b1e643afb32fe40174de62a65c52/header.jpg?t=1745220497","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Jelli Nook","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Quad-Core i5 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2050 or AMD Radeon RX 6400<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Integrated or dedicated sound card</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["LLimb Games","Grizzly Moose Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0",